# The legacy store-screenshots dump is 40+ multi-MB captures of the old
# Streamly UI and stays ignored. v071 holds the current Play Store assets —
# icon, feature graphic and the screenshots actually being uploaded — which
# are deliverables and belong in the repo.
!store-screenshots/v071/
!store-screenshots/v071/**

# Kotlin incremental build state (Gradle 9 / AGP 8.12)
android/.kotlin/
